      "content": "it's not just a feeling though. i've been tracking my output and the drop-off is too consistent whenever i use these specific ones. and it's not just about \"hearing\" a sound, it's like a resonance. i was reading a forum where other artists mentioned feeling this exact same cognitive dampening with AuraSonic gear. i feel like they're using some kind of proprietary frequency modulation to keep people from thinking outside the box, almost like a way to keep the \"creative\" crowd compliant. i need to know if there's a way to detect if there's an active sub-audible carrier frequency being used, or how i can build some kind of shield for my workspace so i can actually work again.",
